            "sid": "JER 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji etejo Olaitoriani, “Shomo, inyiang'u endukuny o laitobirani loo nkulupuok, niya embata oo lpayiani loo ltung'ana o embata oo lapolosak kituaak, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.23.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 23.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.30+JER.7.31+JER.7.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 7.30-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.32.34+JER.32.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32.34-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nimpang alo oyarata lo layioni le Hinom tenejing'ieki enkishomi e Poshed, nimbalunye teine lelo rorei laaliki nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nijo iyie, ‘Entoning ororei lo Laitoriani, intae ilaiguanak le Yuda oloomanya Yerusalem. Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel, ng'ura kayau nanu entorroni shumata ene wueji ometaa ore nkiyiaa e pooki ng'ae oning ena neng'eyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkaraki naatung'uaitie nanu iltung'ana, neisarkione ninche ene wueji etapejokito enkorropil tiatua ine kulie aitin neitu eyiolou ninche arashu iloomenye arashu ilaiguanak le Yuda; o enkaraki naiputa ninche ene wueji osarge le lelo lemeeta ntiot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 18.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " netesheta iwuejitin neeika e Baal pee epejie ilayiok lenye te nkima anaa ilasarri oopejori te Baal, lelo leitu nanu aitanapisho aashu alimu, neitu ejing atua endamunoto ai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ura, kepuonu nkolong'i, Olaitoriani ojo, nemeitokini aajo ene wueji Tofet, aashu oyarata lo layioni le Hinom, kake oyarata le sesekuanare o lalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore tiatua ene wueji kainyal nanu nkitobirat e Yuda o Yerusalem, naisho ene metabatatayu to lalem te dukuya ilmang'ati lenye, o te nkaina e lelo ooing'oru enkishui enye kaisho nanu mpopoki enye metaa endaa oo motonyi oloing'ang'e o ng'uesi enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitaa nanu ena anasa entoki naitureisho, entoki naing'asiakinoi; ore pooki ng'ae ogiroo ninye neiputukuny neing'asia tenkaraki enkidaaroto enye pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naisho nanu meinosa ninche nkiri oo layiok lenye o noo ntoyie enye, nenya pooki ng'ae nkiri e ilo lelatia enye emanitae ninche o to sina, opik ninche ilmang'ati lenye, o lelo ooing'oru enkishui enye neisomit ninche.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nibel iyie ina dukuny te dukuya lelo tung'ana oopuo tenebo iyie! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nijoki iyie ninche, ‘Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani: Neaku kadanyidany nanu kulo tung'ana o ena anasa anaa enadany oltung'ani entoki oo nkulupuok, o metaa meigili ae kata aaram. Nenukaa iltung'ana ninye te Tofet amu meitokini aata ewueji nenukarieki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji nanu aitaas ene wueji, Olaitoriani ojo, o lelo oomanya, aitotiu ena anasa anaa Tofet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nkajijik e Yerusalem o nkajijik oo laiguanak le Yuda nena ajijik pooki naatapejorieki enkorropil inchumat enye tenkaraki olorora pooki le shumata neibukorieki ilasarri ooki tenkaraki nkulie aitin naa keisarkionieki anaa ewueji e Tofet.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yeremia alotu eing'uaa Tofet, ine apa neirriwayie Olaitoriani ninye meshomo aibonisho, neitashe ninye to lgoriet le nkaji e Nkai, nejoki ninye iltung'ana pooki: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel, ng'ura kayaki nanu shumata ena anasa o shumata nkang'itie enyena ina torroni, pooki natejo kaitaas ninye, enkaraki naitagolo ninche lukuny enye, eany ening irorei laainei.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
